CM TM-WHP-NEC-005
CM 5.6m telescopic whip, 20m band — resonant QW (no loading coil)
CM ---------------------------------------------------------------
CM Antenna: 7-section telescopic whip, retracted to 5.13m
CM   True QW at 14.175 MHz = c/(4*f) = 5.285m in free space
CM   Velocity factor ~0.97 for thin whip over ground -> ~5.13m
CM   No loading coil required; whip slightly short, small +jX at feed
CM
CM Wire geometry:
CM   GW 1: main whip, 35 segs, z=0.005 to z=5.135, radius=0.006m
CM   GW 2: radial +X, z=0.005, length=5.13m
CM   GW 3: radial -X, z=0.005, length=5.13m
CM   GW 4: radial +Y, z=0.005, length=5.13m
CM   GW 5: radial -Y, z=0.005, length=5.13m
CM
CM Ground: real average soil (GN 2), sigma=0.005 S/m, epsilon_r=13
CM Feed: voltage source EX 0 on segment 1 of GW1 (base of whip)
CM No LD card — resonant operation, no loading required
CM
CM Note: 20m is the design pivot band for this antenna
CM   Full extension (5.6m) is slightly long at 14 MHz (0.262 lambda)
CM   5.13m trim gives near-resonant Z at band center
CM   Expected feedpoint Z ~ 35-50 ohms resistive at resonance
CE
GW 1 35  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 0.0 5.135  0.006
GW 2 18  0.0 0.0 0.005  5.13 0.0 0.005  0.006
GW 3 18  0.0 0.0 0.005 -5.13 0.0 0.005  0.006
GW 4 18  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 5.13 0.005  0.006
GW 5 18  0.0 0.0 0.005  0.0 -5.13 0.005  0.006
GE 1
GN 2 0 0 0  13 0.005
EX 0 1 1 0  1 0
FR 0 8 0 0  14.000 0.050
RP 0 37 73 1000  0 0 5 5
EN
